# Resturanet invariants

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` before editing.
- Keep Resturanet offline, local-first, desktop-only, and single-user.
- Do not add accounts, cloud/sync, remote content, inventory, recipes, meal
  costing, or multi-restaurant scope without explicit authorization.
- Main owns SQLite/files/privileged APIs; preload is a typed allowlist; renderer
  is unprivileged React; shared code is serializable and side-effect free.
- Validate every IPC input with Zod and use transactions for related writes.
- Store integer IQD and Baghdad business dates as `YYYY-MM-DD`.
- Keep purchases, recorded expense, cash out, supplier debt, and result
  independent. One real movement is posted exactly once.
- Arabic is default; every system surface works in AR/RTL and EN/LTR. Never
  translate or rewrite user-entered data.
- Preserve existing databases, backups, attachments, and recoverable deletion.
- Never commit generated builds, restaurant data, backups, logs, credentials,
  or machine-specific paths.

Use the targeted rules and `.cursor/reference/` files for procedural detail.
